        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3df18163-f19c-4fde-9780-3050436ab053).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. The Carlisles are hosting a garden party at their mansion where they have invited multiple Providence members for a meeting. Eliminate providence chairmen Edward Coleman and Nathaniel Kevinson. Eliminate Lucy Phillips and Sebastian Sato after they escaped from the Burj Al Gazali in Dubai. Finally, Samuel Taylor, the Constant&apos;s personal bodyguard who has been temporarily contracted as the head of the security detail for the event.",
